title: "The Six-Trap Conjecture"
version: "1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23357210"
url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23357210"
authors:
  - family-names: "Washington"
    given-names: "Adrien"
abstract: "An AI-assisted integer-dynamics project centered on the conjecture that every integer n >= 2 reaches one of six recorded periodic cycles under T(n)=n+D(n)-D(n+1). The universal conjecture remains unresolved."
keywords:
  - integer dynamics
  - divisor function
  - recurrence
  - computational mathematics
  - conjecture
